; Neon game music - edit with NeonMusicEditor (NeonGrid SDL3 GPU Tools) or by hand.
; Melody: one token per step, bars separated by |. Tokens: scale degree 1-7,
;   ' octave up, , octave down, # sharp, b flat; - hold, . rest.
; Patterns (one char per step): Arp 0-3 chord tone / . rest; Bass R root, O octave,
;   5 fifth, . release; Comp and drums x hit / . rest.
; Waves: sine triangle square pulse25 saw supersaw pad bell musicbox marimba pluck
;   flute rhodes bass basspluck. Kits: synth chip light.

